---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";
import joinUs from "~/assets/join_us.webp";
import logomarkGold from "~/assets/logomark-double-gold.png";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl space-y-20 p-8">
    <section class="flex flex-col gap-4 space-y-2">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:justify-between">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
          <h2 class="text-balance font-extrabold text-6xl">
            Join us at Teknikfokus
          </h2>
          <p class="max-w-prose">
            Embrace this opportunity to be at the forefront of innovation and
            talent acquisition. We are excited to see how your company will
            inspire and lead in this dynamic environment. For more information
            and to register your interest, please contact us at <a
              class="font-bold underline"
              href="mailto:relations@teknikfokus.se"
            >
              relations@teknikfokus.se</a
            >.
          </p>
          <p class="max-w-prose">
            We look forward to welcoming you to an event that promises to be as
            transformative for your company as it will be for the aspiring
            professionals attending. Let's shape the future together at
            Teknikfokus 2026!
          </p>
          <p>See you at the fair!</p>
        </div>
        <Image
          class="w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden rounded-xl object-cover shadow-md md:max-w-md"
          src={joinUs}
          alt="Company representatives at Teknikfokus"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-balance font-extrabold text-6xl">Prices</h2>

      <!-- boxes -->
      <div
        class="mx-auto mb-5 grid w-full grid-cols-1 justify-items-center gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3"
      >
        <!-- box 1 -->
        <div
          class="h-full min-w-80 max-w-96 flex-1 rounded-xl bg-offset shadow-md lg:mx-auto"
        >
          <!-- Header -->

          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
              <div>
                <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl">Standard</h2>
                <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl">1 Day</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
                <Icon name="logomark" class="size-16" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Price Section -->

          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-center">
              <span class="font-bold text-4xl">31 000 kr</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Features List -->

          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">3x2m exhibition area</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">One (1) bar table and one (1) bar chair</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">Access to a career fair host</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Access to focus lounge, wardrobe and information desk</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Breakfast, coffee and refreshments during the day</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Lunch tickets for two (2) company representatives</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">One (1) free parking ticket</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Two (2) tickets to the Teknikfokus banquet</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">Access to Wi-Fi and electrical outlets</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- box 2 -->
        <div
          class="h-full min-w-80 max-w-96 flex-1 rounded-xl bg-offset shadow-md lg:mx-auto"
        >
          <!-- Header -->

          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
              <div>
                <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl">Standard</h2>
                <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl">2 Days</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
                <Icon name="logomark-double" class="h-16 w-auto" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Price Section -->

          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-center">
              <span class="font-bold text-4xl">43 000 kr</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Features List -->

          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">3x2m exhibition area</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">One (1) bar table and one (1) bar chair</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">Access to a career fair host</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Access to focus lounge, wardrobe and information desk</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Breakfast, coffee and refreshments during both days</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Lunch tickets for two (2) company representatives per day</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">One (1) free parking ticket per day</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Two (2) tickets to the Teknikfokus banquet</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">Access to Wi-Fi and electrical outlets</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- box 3 -->
        <div
          class="h-full min-w-80 max-w-96 flex-1 rounded-xl bg-offset shadow-md lg:mx-auto"
        >
          <!-- Header -->

          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
              <div>
                <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl">Luxury</h2>
                <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl">2 Days</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
                <Image
                  src={logomarkGold}
                  alt=""
                  class="h-16 w-auto"
                  style="filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0.45rem #7a5d0e)"
                />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Price Section -->

          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-center">
              <span class="font-bold text-4xl">48 000 kr</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Features List -->

          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">3x2m exhibition area</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">40" TV Screen</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Two (2) bar tables and two (2) bar chairs</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">Access to a private career fair host</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Access to focus lounge, wardrobe and information desk</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Breakfast, coffee and refreshments during both days</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Lunch tickets for three (3) company representatives per day</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">One (1) free parking ticket</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Three (3) tickets to the Teknikfokus banquet</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2">Access to Wi-Fi and electrical outlets</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >One week of on-site marketing prior to the fair</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <div class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0">
                  <Icon name="checkmark" class="size-6 text-green-500" />
                </div>
                <span class="ml-2"
                  >Automatic reservation of the best exhibition stand spots</span
                >
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center">
        Special offers apply for companies in the Biomedical Engineering
        industry! Please contact us for more information <a
          class="font-bold underline"
          href="mailto:relations@teknikfokus.se">relations@teknikfokus.se</a
        >.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-balance font-extrabold text-6xl">Add-Ons</h2>
      <p>
        Want to add something to your experience at Teknikfokus? We have plenty
        of add-ons to offer!
      </p>
      <div class="min-w-80 rounded-xl bg-offset shadow-md">
        <div class="pb-3 pl-6 pr-6 pt-3">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">Extra bar chair</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-auto flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">300 kr/pc</h2>
              <Icon name="plus" class="size-8" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-3 pl-6 pr-6 pt-3">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">Extra bar table</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-auto flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">400 kr/pc</h2>
              <Icon name="plus" class="size-8" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-3 pl-6 pr-6 pt-3">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">TV 40"</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-auto flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">2800 kr/pc</h2>
              <Icon name="plus" class="size-8" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-3 pl-6 pr-6 pt-3">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">TV 50"</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-auto flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">3400 kr/pc</h2>
              <Icon name="plus" class="size-8" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-3 pl-6 pr-6 pt-3">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">Extra lunch ticket</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-auto flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">120 kr/pc</h2>
              <Icon name="plus" class="size-8" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-3 pl-6 pr-6 pt-3">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">Extra banquet ticket</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-auto flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">400 kr/pc</h2>
              <Icon name="plus" class="size-8" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-3 pl-6 pr-6 pt-3">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">Extra parking spot</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-auto flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">30 kr/pc</h2>
              <Icon name="plus" class="size-8" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-3 pl-6 pr-6 pt-3">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">Spot selection</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="hidden justify-center lg:flex">
              <p class="w-2/3 text-sm">
                Allows you to pick which spot in the exhibition hall you would
                like to claim to best market your company
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">3000 kr/pc</h2>
              <Icon name="plus" class="size-8" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-balance font-extrabold text-6xl">Event packages</h2>
      <!-- boxes -->
      <div
        class="mx-auto mb-5 grid w-full grid-cols-1 justify-items-center gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3"
      >
        <!-- box 1 -->
        <div
          class="h-full min-w-80 max-w-96 flex-1 rounded-xl bg-offset shadow-md lg:mx-auto"
        >
          <!-- Header -->

          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
              <div>
                <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl">Lunch</h2>
                <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl">Lecture</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
                <Icon name="lunchlecture" class="h-16 w-auto" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Price Section -->

          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-center">
              <span>From</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-2xl">12 000 kr</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Features List  -->

          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <p>
              The perfect opportunity for you and your company to display the
              latest technology, innovations, and projects to the students. It
              will enchance your company's visibility and making your brand more
              attractive and well-known among our dear students.
            </p>
            <br />
            <p class="font-bold">
              Lunch lectures last the entire lunch and allow for 45 minutes of
              presentation
            </p>
            <br />
            <p>
              It is recommended to offer complimentary lunch for the attending
              students, since it has been proven to significantly increase
              attendance. We offer the following:
            </p>
            <br />
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-bold">One (1) ciabatta and one (1) drink</span
                >
                <span class="font-bold">60 kr / attendee</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-bold">One (1) salad and one (1) drink</span>
                <span class="font-bold">100 kr / attendee</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- box 2 -->
        <div
          class="h-full min-w-80 max-w-96 flex-1 rounded-xl bg-offset shadow-md lg:mx-auto"
        >
          <!-- Header -->

          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
              <div>
                <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl">Student</h2>
                <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl">Session</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
                <Icon name="studentsession" class="h-16 w-auto" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Price Section -->

          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
              <div>
                <p class="font-bold text-xl">One day</p>
                <p class="font-bold text-xl">4 000 kr</p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="font-bold text-xl">Two days</p>
                <p class="font-bold text-xl">6 000 kr</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Features List -->

          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <p>
              Seeking to recruit new talent in person? Then the Student Sessions
              are perfect for you. With one-on-one meetings, discussions, or
              interviews with students, you can meet your next Master's thesis
              writers, summer workers, and ambitious interns. Each session lasts
              about 30 to 45 minutes.
            </p>

            <br />
            <p>
              Students apply for the sessions prior to the fair by submitting a
              CV along with a complementary cover letter. Then, you may handpick
              applicants that you are interested in meeting. Teknikfokus handles
              all the contact with the students, appointment scheduling and
              room-bookings on your behalf.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- box 3 -->
        <div
          class="h-full min-w-80 max-w-96 flex-1 rounded-xl bg-offset shadow-md lg:mx-auto"
        >
          <!-- Header -->

          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
              <div>
                <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl">Pub</h2>
                <h2 class="select-none font-bold opacity-0 text-2xl">Pub</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
                <Icon name="pub" class="h-16 w-auto" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Price Section -->

          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-center">
              <span>From</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-2xl">16 000 kr</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-center"><p>+ cost of food</p></div>
          </div>

          <!-- Features List -->

          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <p>
              What is the best way to a student's heart if not through alcohol?
              At Teknikfokus, we offer you the opportunity to host a pub on
              campus and mingle with students in a more relaxed atmosphere, with
              the help of volunteering students from the D- or E-guild. Like the
              lunch lectures, pubs are much loved by the students, so take the
              chance to find new talent and colleagues to recruit today.
            </p>

            <br />
            <p>
              Food and drinks will be served by D- or E-guild students. Please
              note that the price <span class="font-bold"
                >does not include the cost of food</span
              > sold during the event. You get to decide how much you wish to spend
              on food provided to the guests.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="flex flex-col gap-4 space-y-2">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
          <h2 class="text-balance font-extrabold text-6xl">FAQ</h2>
        </div>
        <details class="bg-offset p-8">
          <summary class="font-bold">Why Teknikfokus?</summary>
          What makes us stand out is not our banquet or lounges, it is our students.
          Here at E-huset we pride ourselves in our desire to learn, our desire to
          specialize and our desire to develop and create. This is the place for
          you to meet the future’s brightest engineers in software, biomedicine,
          electronics, computer science, information and communication technologies
          as well as other amazing specialities. This is the fair for those who want
          to reach new levels in the world of engineering.
        </details>
        <details class="bg-offset p-8">
          <summary class="font-bold">When is Teknikfokus?</summary>
          The fair will take place between 09:00 and 15:00, the 10th & 11th of February.
        </details>
        <details class="bg-offset p-8">
          <summary class="font-bold">Where will Teknikfokus take place?</summary
          >
          At Ole Römers väg 3, inside E-huset.
